  "description": "WebSvc.UnifiedMessaging.Core is a .NET library for building scalable and extensible unified messaging workflows. \nIt provides interfaces, repositories, and services for outbound message queuing, rate limiting, and quota enforcement. \nDesigned with a pluggable architecture, it supports multiple data sources, delivery channels, and processing pipelines \nfor validation, transformation, and enrichment.",
